{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37974","headline":"和吴子华侍郎令狐昭化舍人叹白菊衰谢之绝次山本韵 · 韩偓","name":"和吴子华侍郎令狐昭化舍人叹白菊衰谢之绝次山本韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"正怜香雪披千片，忽讶残霞覆一丛。\n还似妖姬长年後，酒酣双脸却微红。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37974.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37974","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}